  "title": "Tyson Foods Sizzles with New Grilling Options for Summer 2026",
  "summary": "As summer grilling season heats up, Tyson Foods is expanding its portfolio with bold, ready-to-enjoy offerings across several iconic brands. Designed for backyard cookouts, family time and easy summer meals, the latest innovations from brands like Tyson®, Wright®, Ball Park® and Hillshire Farm® deliver flavor, quality and convenience to grills and gatherings all season long.",
